   "text": "Rustige backwaters en rivieren van Kerala: pure natuur",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_95000bf989d560d69448",
   "sourceHash": "95000bf989d560d69448f469a3aaa3cdcf8de437d716e6172463e65b3ae0e013",
   "text": "Ontdek de rustige backwaters, rivieren en traditionele woonboten van Kerala. Verken schilderachtige landschappen, levendige cultuur en diepe rust.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
